OL,3,ABabydoll singer says life will 'never
OL,4,Abe the same again' after UK number one
OL,5,
OL,6,FJamie Miller says "nothing feels
OL,7,Fnormal" anymore but he is trying to
OL,8,F"live in the moment" as he comes to
OL,9,Fterms with his history-making song
OL,10,FBabydoll.
OL,12,FLast week the 29-year-old became the
OL,13,Ffirst Welsh artist to top the UK
OL,14,Fsingles chart in 15 years with the
OL,15,Fviral TikTok hit.
OL,17,FThe singer, who is originally from
OL,18,FPontprennau in Cardiff, said his dreams
OL,19,Fhad "come true" and life would "never
OL,20,Fbe the same again" after a challenging
OL,21,Ffew years in which he even had to give
OL,22,Fup on music for a time.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
